 "description": "Conduction loss and gate-drive requirements for a MOSFET used as a low-side switch. Conduction + gate-drive ONLY \u2014 switching loss (needs drain voltage and rise/fall times) is NOT included.\n\nP_cond = Id^2 * Rds_on * duty. Gate avg current = Qg * fsw. Gate power = Qg * Vdrive * fsw. Tj = Ta + P_cond * theta_JA.\nArgs: id_a, rds_on_ohm, duty (0-1, default 1); optional qg_c (coulombs), fsw_hz, vdrive_v, theta_ja, ambient_c, tj_max_c (default 150).\nReturns (structured): { p_conduction_w, gate_drive_avg_a, gate_drive_power_w, tj_c, margin_c, ok } (optional fields null if inputs omitted).\nExample: Id=5A, Rds=20m\u03a9 -> 0.5 W conduction; Qg=20nC @ 100kHz -> 2 mA drive.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "ambient_c": {
    "description": "Ambient temperature in \u00b0C",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "duty": {
    "default": 1,
    "description": "Conduction duty cycle 0-1",
    "maximum": 1,
    "minimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "fsw_hz": {
    "description": "Switching frequency in Hz",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "id_a": {
    "description": "Drain (load) current in A",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "qg_c": {
    "description": "Total gate charge in coulombs (20nC = 20e-9)",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "rds_on_ohm": {
    "description": "On-resistance Rds(on) in ohms",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "theta_ja": {
    "description": "Junction-to-ambient thermal resistance \u00b0C/W",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "tj_max_c": {
    "default": 150,
    "description": "Max junction temperature rating in \u00b0C",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "vdrive_v": {
    "description": "Gate drive voltage in V",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   }
  },
  "required": [
